From: Tom Stephens <tstephen@cs.byu.edu>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:47:22 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Record checkouts, at most one open per item
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A Checkout ties an item to a person and a show, with a due date and an
optional returned date; all three are in the admin. The database
refuses a second open checkout for the same item, with a conditional
unique constraint rather than a form check, because the strike-night
observation had three volunteers returning items at once (design §6).
